# Cobo Agentic Wallet keys — COPY to .env (gitignored). NEVER put these in the desk's .env.
# Full walkthrough: see ONBOARDING.md in this folder.
#
# One-time setup (needs YOU — the wallet owner):
#   1. Install the caw CLI:  curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/CoboGlobal/cobo-agentic-wallet/master/install.sh | bash
#   2. caw onboard --wait --invitation-code <code-from-your-Cobo-invite>
#   3. caw wallet pair --code-only   → enter the 8-digit token in the Cobo Agentic Wallet app
#   4. caw wallet current --show-api-key   → gives AGENT_WALLET_API_KEY (+ your wallet UUID)
#
# Optional: testnet first (Sepolia faucet via `caw faucet deposit --token-id SETH --address <addr>`).

AGENT_WALLET_API_URL=https://api.agenticwallet.cobo.com
AGENT_WALLET_API_KEY=your-agent-api-key

# Narrow the tool surface — pact drafting + execution + observer. Deliberately
# EXCLUDES contract_call / message_sign / payment / create_delegation: swaps on
# this lane would need a DEX router + calldata encoder (not wired yet), and
# delegation creation is an owner decision, not an agent one.
AGENT_WALLET_INCLUDE_TOOLS=list_wallets,get_wallet,list_wallet_addresses,get_balance,submit_pact,get_pact,list_pacts,transfer_tokens,estimate_transfer_fee,get_transaction_record_by_request_id,list_transaction_records,get_audit_logs